Provenance: Printed without a number, as 'Dirty Work at the Crosswords'. Numbered 371 here by inference (the user, from the scans): the series runs from No. 370, earlier in this issue, to No. 372 in January 1937, and January 1937 printed this puzzle's solution beside No. 370's. The grid has circled squares; they aren't marked in this transcription yet.


